WEBVTT

00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:07.351
The decision which took
away my happiness.

00:00:10.003 --> 00:00:14.130
Candy went on her first vacation
back to Pony's home.

00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:18.494
She then managed to save her
beloved father-tree.

00:00:19.278 --> 00:00:23.564
Feeling the kindness of sister Pony's
and sister Lane's heart,

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.994
...Candy felt content again
after such a long time.

00:00:38.348 --> 00:00:41.797
Sorry for not being here with you!
Did you miss me?

00:00:46.973 --> 00:00:48.652
Kurin, it's okay now.

00:01:00.405 --> 00:01:01.730
Thanks.

00:01:01.765 --> 00:01:03.536
Here, take this.

00:01:03.571 --> 00:01:06.084
They came from the garden in Pony's home.

00:01:17.581 --> 00:01:22.757
I thought that Candy won't return,
but she's back all refreshed now.

00:01:22.998 --> 00:01:25.108
And Anthony...

00:01:28.336 --> 00:01:32.097
While Candy was gone, I was frequently
riding together with Anthony.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:45.613
When Candy came back, Anthony became
cold to me! What's up with that?

00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:49.638
I'm sorry I have to tell you this,
but you're being way too soft today!

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:55.400
Look, Eliza.

00:02:04.426 --> 00:02:06.006
It's Dorothy.

00:02:07.154 --> 00:02:12.199
Candy, I might have to say farewell
to you soon.

00:02:13.876 --> 00:02:15.351
Why?

00:02:16.142 --> 00:02:17.573
I'm going to Mexico.

00:02:17.608 --> 00:02:21.178
Mexico?
Why are you going to such a faraway place?

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.357
There is an Adley property in Mexico.

00:02:25.392 --> 00:02:29.985
They are lacking in manpower there, so
I've been ordered to go there and help them.

00:02:30.937 --> 00:02:35.160
Many things have happened while I was away
at Pony's home, right?

00:02:35.496 --> 00:02:36.435
Yes.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.934
But... why you?

00:02:38.969 --> 00:02:42.654
They said it's because I'm the
least useful one in this estate.

00:02:43.536 --> 00:02:44.841
But...!

00:02:45.046 --> 00:02:47.202
And... it's decided?

00:02:48.291 --> 00:02:49.166
Yes.

00:02:49.201 --> 00:02:50.612
And now what...

00:02:50.647 --> 00:02:53.481
I don't want to go! I don't want that!

00:02:53.516 --> 00:02:55.684
Why didn't you turn them down?

00:02:57.071 --> 00:02:58.125
Candy!

00:02:59.954 --> 00:03:04.727
I have many little brothers and
sisters in my home.

00:03:05.239 --> 00:03:10.264
If I get fired, I won't have
any money to send back home!

00:03:10.299 --> 00:03:12.866
I'll ask mr. Leagan then!

00:03:13.273 --> 00:03:17.281
He's a reasonable person,
I'm sure he'll listen to your story.

00:03:17.876 --> 00:03:21.021
He won't be back for a long time.

00:03:21.809 --> 00:03:25.180
Anyway, I already set my mind on this,
so it's alright!

00:03:30.292 --> 00:03:32.328
I'm sorry, Dorothy.

00:03:32.363 --> 00:03:34.766
You always knew how to give me strength.

00:03:34.801 --> 00:03:38.102
But I'm not sure what should I do
to give you the strength now.

00:03:39.161 --> 00:03:43.335
It's okay, Candy.
Well, I have things to do.

00:03:44.331 --> 00:03:45.934
Dorothy!

00:03:52.019 --> 00:03:53.691
Poor Dorothy.

00:03:54.138 --> 00:03:59.158
If she goes to such a faraway place,
she might not come back at all.

00:04:03.034 --> 00:04:05.960
Kurin, I'm much luckier than her.

00:04:06.038 --> 00:04:10.704
Pony's home isn't very far, and I'm
living close to Anthony and the others.

00:04:11.306 --> 00:04:15.412
If I set aside Eliza and Neil's pranks,
this is actually a wonderful place!

00:04:15.585 --> 00:04:17.073
How can she say that?

00:04:17.108 --> 00:04:17.944
Eliza!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.294
If she's already become
content with our pranks,

00:04:24.329 --> 00:04:26.444
Let's see how much
she can really take!

00:04:26.479 --> 00:04:27.380
Right, Eliza?

00:04:36.547 --> 00:04:41.183
That's it! I wonder if I could
give this to Dorothy as a memento.

00:04:48.198 --> 00:04:49.515
Sister Pony!

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:52.170
This is a lucky cross.

00:04:52.205 --> 00:04:59.522
If something bad happens to you,
I'm sure this cross will keep you happy.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:06.352
I'm sure sister Pony
would understand!

00:05:13.065 --> 00:05:14.592
I'll remember this, Candy!

00:05:26.464 --> 00:05:27.942
Cleopatra, go!

00:05:42.178 --> 00:05:44.086
It's a lucky cross.

00:05:45.803 --> 00:05:49.929
Thank you, Candy!
I know that it's important to you.

00:05:53.099 --> 00:05:54.391
Cleopatra?

00:05:54.426 --> 00:05:56.382
I wonder why is she running away.

00:05:56.821 --> 00:05:59.019
Dorothy, I'll borrow this rope.

00:05:59.885 --> 00:06:02.476
Wait! Cleopatra!

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:13.767
Isn't that Leagan's Cleopatra?

00:06:16.915 --> 00:06:18.368
Cleopatra!

00:06:19.916 --> 00:06:22.077
Cleopatra!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.951
Candy!

00:06:26.166 --> 00:06:27.894
Anthony!

00:06:28.271 --> 00:06:29.406
Quickly, get on!

00:06:31.253 --> 00:06:32.299
Hang on!

00:06:46.608 --> 00:06:50.866
He appeared at such a great place!
He really is my prince!

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:21.071
You're really good with lasso.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:24.001
I never planned to show you that.

00:07:24.357 --> 00:07:25.255
Why?

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:29.001
Because... it's the tomboyish Candy.

00:07:29.036 --> 00:07:30.080
I like her.

00:07:30.273 --> 00:07:31.225
Really?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:31.889
Yeah.

00:07:35.856 --> 00:07:38.814
Anthony...
I like you, too!

00:07:49.434 --> 00:07:50.672
Alright! You're home.

00:07:50.917 --> 00:07:52.249
Thank you, Anthony.

00:07:55.363 --> 00:07:58.319
Candy, let's ride again some time.

00:07:58.354 --> 00:07:59.074
Yes!

00:08:01.799 --> 00:08:03.399
Well then, goodbye.

00:08:03.434 --> 00:08:04.358
Goodbye!

00:08:07.599 --> 00:08:11.925
Anthony... Candy was
in trouble and he...!

00:08:14.495 --> 00:08:18.681
I'll remember this, Candy!
I'll get you thrown out from here, for sure!

00:08:25.956 --> 00:08:29.710
Got it? Be extremely careful
during the dinner!

00:08:29.745 --> 00:08:31.731
And don't rush with anything.

00:08:32.548 --> 00:08:36.191
Grand aunt Elroy is a very strict person.

00:08:36.559 --> 00:08:39.504
You understand?
Oh, Eliza!

00:08:39.539 --> 00:08:40.767
Yes, Mother!

00:08:40.802 --> 00:08:42.937
Do you know where is my emerald brooch?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.372
No, and moreover, I can't find my bracelet!

00:08:47.721 --> 00:08:49.394
That's strange.

00:08:49.542 --> 00:08:52.367
I must have dropped it somewhere
underneath the dresser...

00:08:52.599 --> 00:08:53.691
Mother!

00:08:54.036 --> 00:08:56.636
Aunt Elroy's car is coming this way!

00:08:57.022 --> 00:08:58.521
Oh, no!

00:08:58.556 --> 00:09:00.266
Everyone, hurry up!

00:09:00.527 --> 00:09:02.253
Hey, hey!

00:09:02.499 --> 00:09:04.249
Is it Anthony?

00:09:04.284 --> 00:09:06.891
Sorry, it's aunt.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.751
I wanted him to see how
perfect I am.

00:09:13.931 --> 00:09:16.857
Great aunt Elroy has just arrived.

00:09:27.907 --> 00:09:31.030
Welcome, great aunt Elroy.

00:09:38.373 --> 00:09:41.055
Welcome, aunt.

00:09:41.208 --> 00:09:43.665
What's with that sad face?

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:49.199
I'm very sorry. It seems that a brooch
I got from you disappeared somehow.

00:09:49.426 --> 00:09:51.824
My bracelet is gone, too!

00:09:52.136 --> 00:09:54.545
That's your own fault.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:57.313
Mother! It's an emergency!

00:09:58.097 --> 00:10:02.612
What are you doing? Why are you
running in front of aunt Elroy?

00:10:03.805 --> 00:10:06.073
I found both the brooch and the bracelet!

00:10:08.469 --> 00:10:10.237
I've been looking for those!

00:10:10.805 --> 00:10:11.960
Where have you found them?

00:10:11.995 --> 00:10:14.249
In the barn, with Candy's things.

00:10:20.098 --> 00:10:22.716
She might have taken other
things, as well.

00:10:24.401 --> 00:10:28.600
How horrible. So that's how
she's repaying your kindness.

00:10:29.023 --> 00:10:30.363
I'll go look.

00:10:31.172 --> 00:10:32.547
I'll go as well.

00:10:39.025 --> 00:10:41.797
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Uh, that carrot-devouring horse
looked kinda weird...

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.669
The barrel is finally full now.

00:11:00.453 --> 00:11:03.166
What's the matter?
Everybody has that scary look...

00:11:04.006 --> 00:11:07.575
Candy. We are going to
take a look in the barn.

00:11:22.779 --> 00:11:26.828
Neil, Eliza, turn everything upside down.

00:11:27.115 --> 00:11:28.015
Yes!

00:11:37.406 --> 00:11:43.104
Wait! You allowed them to go
through my things and luggage?

00:11:43.464 --> 00:11:44.708
That's right.

00:11:44.764 --> 00:11:47.416
Stop that!
I won't let you do that!

00:11:48.387 --> 00:11:52.648
What did you say?
Thieves don't have the right to say that!

00:11:53.363 --> 00:11:54.435
Thieves?

00:12:02.395 --> 00:12:04.550
Eliza, what is the meaning of that?

00:12:05.612 --> 00:12:07.235
Just what is this?

00:12:08.722 --> 00:12:10.254
It's my dress!

00:12:15.594 --> 00:12:17.011
Mother's ring!

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:21.872
I don't know about that!

00:12:22.119 --> 00:12:23.829
Huh? What's this ribbon?

00:12:24.721 --> 00:12:27.020
Why, that's Annie's ribbon!

00:12:27.164 --> 00:12:29.727
Candy, what's up with this ribbon?

00:12:29.916 --> 00:12:31.701
That's...

00:12:40.925 --> 00:12:44.299
I won't tell them. I won't tell the truth.

00:12:44.334 --> 00:12:49.752
...that we both lived in Pony's home.
I'll keep quiet for Annie's sake.

00:12:51.345 --> 00:12:53.822
You even stole the ribbon from Annie?

00:12:53.857 --> 00:12:55.341
I didn't!

00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:57.495
How did you get it then?

00:12:58.152 --> 00:13:00.485
Miss Annie gave it to me!

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:03.706
Annie wouldn't give something like this
to a complete stranger!

00:13:06.683 --> 00:13:10.722
I'm disgusted!
What a horrible child!

00:13:13.312 --> 00:13:16.723
She exposed her true nature now.

00:13:18.988 --> 00:13:21.538
I don't know!
I know nothing about this!

00:13:21.539 --> 00:13:23.266
I don't remember anything!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:29.847
Candy, I won't put up with this anymore!

00:13:29.882 --> 00:13:33.699
Candy, instead of Dorothy,
I'm sending you to Mexico!

00:13:35.724 --> 00:13:37.350
Me? To Mexico!?

00:13:37.385 --> 00:13:41.668
Yes. I won't allow thieves
to live in this household!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:46.454
But... if mr. Leagan knew this,
I'm sure he'd be against it!

00:13:46.489 --> 00:13:50.063
What?! A servant, she even
dares to drag mr. Leagan into this!

00:13:50.098 --> 00:13:52.464
I'm sure he would understand...!

00:13:52.499 --> 00:13:55.105
I'm going to write a letter to
him and explain the situation!

00:13:56.803 --> 00:14:01.171
The girl he brought here as a playmate
for Eliza turned out to be a thief!

00:14:01.206 --> 00:14:03.243
There's no way Father could forgive her!

00:14:04.355 --> 00:14:10.614
Madam! Madam, please!
Just don't send Candy to Mexico!

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:11.735
Dorothy!

00:14:14.021 --> 00:14:17.509
I'm the one who's supposed
to go to Mexico!

00:14:17.703 --> 00:14:22.362
Yes. It would be better if you
just handed her over to the police.

00:14:22.462 --> 00:14:26.299
No, aunt. If people learned that
we were harboring a thief,

00:14:26.334 --> 00:14:30.440
it would bring great shame to the Leagan
family. Even the Adleys would look bad.

00:14:30.475 --> 00:14:32.528
Maybe that's so...

00:14:32.812 --> 00:14:34.353
Do you understand, Candy?

00:14:34.388 --> 00:14:39.599
You'll be heading for Mexico as soon
as possible! Pack your bags now!

00:14:50.529 --> 00:14:51.561
Candy...

00:14:51.584 --> 00:14:52.754
Dorothy.

00:14:53.343 --> 00:14:57.657
Finally...
Finally, it came to an end.

00:15:02.667 --> 00:15:04.721
Candy, I'll return this to you.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:11.809
If it's become like this,
I'll let you have it again!

00:15:12.201 --> 00:15:16.955
Because the situation with you
and me had reversed completely!

00:15:17.024 --> 00:15:18.263
Dorothy!

00:15:21.712 --> 00:15:29.232
Candy, don't let go of this.
Because this is a lucky cross!

00:15:29.594 --> 00:15:32.479
I am not going to Mexico!

00:15:32.514 --> 00:15:34.253
I'm going to run away from here.

00:15:34.288 --> 00:15:36.521
Candy! You mustn't do that!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.015
Why?

00:15:39.081 --> 00:15:41.125
This is not a problem of you alone!

00:15:42.619 --> 00:15:45.156
You have many children in Pony's
home behind you!

00:15:45.265 --> 00:15:47.431
Children in Pony's home...

00:15:50.982 --> 00:15:55.391
If you run away from here,
the rumours will spread around,

00:15:55.426 --> 00:15:59.483
...and people who want to adopt children
will stop coming to Pony's home.

00:16:00.325 --> 00:16:04.009
Then... are you saying I should
keep quiet and go to Mexico?

00:16:04.455 --> 00:16:09.286
Be patient. I'm sure the
truth will come out someday.

00:16:10.408 --> 00:16:13.573
If you have that lucky cross,
you can make yourself a chance!

00:16:13.574 --> 00:16:14.554
I'm sure!

00:16:15.101 --> 00:16:16.021
Candy!

00:16:29.896 --> 00:16:30.797
Candy.

00:16:31.628 --> 00:16:35.577
What a rain!
It cooled me off a bit!

00:16:38.901 --> 00:16:41.087
Dorothy, you'd better head back in.

00:16:41.498 --> 00:16:42.564
Candy!

00:16:43.184 --> 00:16:46.373
If you don't come back soon,
they'll scold you again!

00:16:46.767 --> 00:16:48.607
Yeah! See you then!

00:17:15.958 --> 00:17:18.973
Because they said I'm a thief...
I have to go to Mexico.

00:17:21.646 --> 00:17:25.177
To a faraway place, with no
memories or people I know.

00:17:26.541 --> 00:17:27.896
I don't want that!

00:17:28.302 --> 00:17:30.069
I don't want to go to Mexico!

00:17:38.114 --> 00:17:40.313
I don't want to part
from Anthony.

00:17:41.257 --> 00:17:42.794
I want to stay here forever.

00:17:43.638 --> 00:17:45.344
But... what should I do?

00:17:55.447 --> 00:17:57.101
There's mr. Albert, too!

00:18:17.532 --> 00:18:19.601
Candy is going to Mexico?

00:18:32.264 --> 00:18:33.526
Raise your hands!

00:18:37.524 --> 00:18:38.433
A bum, right?

00:18:38.468 --> 00:18:40.259
What are you doing here?

00:18:41.737 --> 00:18:46.447
Mr. land keeper, you found me. However,
I'm not ready to leave this place yet.

00:18:58.192 --> 00:19:01.073
Running away, some guy you are!

00:19:01.455 --> 00:19:04.316
This time, I'll throw you out myself.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.589
Pack your stuff, and get out of this place!

00:19:15.138 --> 00:19:16.479
Move it!

00:19:17.484 --> 00:19:18.664
What's that?

00:19:19.825 --> 00:19:20.371
Don't touch that!

00:19:20.406 --> 00:19:25.037
Got it? If I find you inside the Adley
property again, I'm gonna shoot you dead!

00:19:40.617 --> 00:19:41.733
Candy...

00:19:57.392 --> 00:20:01.456
Mr. Albert! Mr. Albert!
Why didn't you come soon?

00:20:01.741 --> 00:20:02.959
Mr Albe.....

00:20:05.269 --> 00:20:06.454
Mr. Albert?

00:20:19.577 --> 00:20:21.082
Mr. Albert's sunglasses.

00:20:26.251 --> 00:20:28.938
Mr. Albert already left this place.

00:20:42.473 --> 00:20:45.786
Leaving... to some new places - -

00:20:48.351 --> 00:20:52.436
Mr. Albert is trying to find
a new place for himself.

00:20:56.642 --> 00:21:01.894
Anthony, Archie and Stear...
I want all of you to believe.

00:21:02.161 --> 00:21:03.948
Believe that I'm not a thief.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.936
I'm going to Mexico.
I'm going for sure!

00:21:10.406 --> 00:21:17.463
Courage appeared in Candy's heart.
A heart which was not afraid of the unknown.

00:21:17.498 --> 00:21:20.282
To be continued...
